          "comment": "His C&D win last August was a career best; close third at Redcar latest; high on the list",
          "spotlight": "Two wins during last season's 3yo campaign, including over C&D (good to firm) when posting a career-best performance; returned to form with close third at Redcar last month and he's high on the list.",
          "medical": [],
          "quotes": [
            {
              "date": "2024-06-22",
              "horse": "Jesmond Dawn",
              "horse_id": "5073257",
              "race": "Market Cross Jewellers Handicap",
              "race_id": "869262",
              "course": "Redcar",
              "course_id": "crs_1222",
              "distance_f": "6",
              "distance_y": "1317",
              "quote": "It was a good shout from Grant as I didn't think this would be Jesmond Dawn's trip. We thought a fair bit of him as a two-year-old and he disappointed a bit, so it's good to get his head in front - Sam James, rider, speaking to Racing TV."
            }
          ],
          "stable_tour": [
            {
              "horse": "Jesmond Dawn",
              "horse_id": "5073257",
              "quote": "He was an expensive purchase but anything he does this season will be a bonus as he's bred to be more of a three-year-old. He finished third on his debut at Ripon, one place ahead of a horse who is now rated 80. On the day he was too keen and went too fast, but he'll have learned plenty from that. I hope to find a backend maiden before putting him away for next year. He looks a nice prospect. 30-08-23"
            }
          ],
