          "comment": "Won off this mark at Musselburgh in April but unable to threaten on his three runs since",
          "spotlight": "8yo whose last three wins have come at Musselburgh, the latest off this mark in April; however, he's been unable to threaten away from the Edinburgh venue on his last three starts and has to raise his game.",
          "medical": [],
          "quotes": [
            {
              "date": "2024-09-15",
              "horse": "Zarzyni",
              "horse_id": "2710303",
              "race": "Watch On Racing TV Handicap",
              "race_id": "874824",
              "course": "Musselburgh",
              "course_id": "crs_416",
              "distance_f": "5",
              "distance_y": "1101",
              "quote": "It worked out well. I haven't a clue why Zarzyni won there, we've tried everything with him. He's very smart, but I don't think the horse knows he's won. If he had time to think he'd have got beaten. He's a handy type to have in the yard as he's a very good work horse. When we have sprinters we have to work, he's the boy. We're thankful he's won and Musselburgh's been a lucky place for us -  oint-trainer David Barron, speaking on Racing TV."
            },
            {
              "date": "2019-06-16",
              "horse": "Zarzyni",
              "horse_id": "2710303",
              "race": "Irish Stallion Farms EBF Maiden (Plus 10 Race)",
              "race_id": "733390",
              "course": "Gowran Park",
              "course_id": "crs_4784",
              "distance_f": "7",
              "distance_y": "1540",
              "quote": "Zarzyni is very straightforward and had been working well. For one of ours to win first time is always a good sign. We thought he was up to winning a maiden but not necessarily first time - Michael Halford, trainer."
            }
          ],
