          "stable_tour": [
            {
              "horse": "My Chiquita",
              "horse_id": "4485054",
              "quote": "She's 2-2 for us over hurdles and is having a break as she wants better ground. She won well at Sedgefield and Wetherby and we'll get her ready for the mares' meeting at Cheltenham in April. She'll have a couple of options there, either a handicap hurdle or Listed novice hurdle. It's all about building a pedigree with her to go on as a broodmare. 30-11-23"
            }
          ],
