          "comment": "Last two wins were in claiming hurdles for Archie Watson; recent fourth over fences",
          "spotlight": "Latest two wins were in claiming hurdles for Archie Watson; last of four over fences on recent stable debut but didn't run at all badly; this is a warm handicap, however.",
          "medical": [],
          "quotes": [
            {
              "date": "2022-10-12",
              "horse": "Collingham",
              "horse_id": "3272360",
              "race": "Wetherby Racecourse Supporting Spinal Research Conditional Jockeys' Handicap Hurdle",
              "race_id": "821405",
              "course": "Wetherby",
              "course_id": "crs_2262",
              "distance_f": "16",
              "distance_y": "3520",
              "quote": "I thought Collingham might need it a touch because he hasn't been away for a gallop but he's been doing plenty at home. The quick ground would have helped him and he's a grand little horse - Theo Gillard, jockey."
            }
          ],
          "stable_tour": [
            {
              "horse": "Collingham",
              "horse_id": "3272360",
              "quote": "He joined us from France last season and has been a remarkably consistent horse, winning three times with five second placings. He ran a nice race when second to stablemate Nayati in the valuable Hogmaneigh Handicap at Musselburgh off a mark of 121 and he went back to the Edinburgh track last weekend for the County Hurdle on Trials day and he won well. I was very pleased with that win - it was a good performance and clearly the drying ground made the difference. We have no immediate plan but to keep enjoying him while he is in this form. 09-02-23"
            }
          ],
