          "comment": "Won last two on good ground at Listowel, gets weight from the boys, preferred by Townend",
          "spotlight": "Struggled on heavy ground on debut in a Fairyhouse bumper but has won both starts since on good ground, a 16.5f Listowel bumper by 6.5l in June 2024 and a 2m mares' maiden hurdle after a year off; the choice of Townend and gets weight from the boys; unexposed and leading chance.",
          "medical": [],
          "quotes": [
            {
              "date": "2025-06-02",
              "horse": "La Note Verte",
              "horse_id": "5713812",
              "race": "Nora Canty Mares Maiden Hurdle",
              "race_id": "896890",
              "course": "Listowel",
              "course_id": "crs_4940",
              "distance_f": "16",
              "distance_y": "3520",
              "quote": "La Note Verte likes it around here. It wasn't the deepest of races I would say but she jumped like a buck and I would say that is her asset. She can build on that, she has little experience but she jumped so well for first time out. Her jumping will bring her a long way. She will have to build on what she has done there to be competitive throughout the summer but she is entitled to. When I hit the ground she was still green enough so I hope she can keep improving - Paul Townend, jockey."
            }
          ],
